   846                              <1> decimalise:
   847                              <1> ;Input: rax = value to decimalise
   848                              <1> ;       rdi -> Ptr to byte buffer to store string in with commas
   849                              <1> ;       ecx = buffer length
   850                              <1> ;Output: Buffer @ rdi filled in! 
   851                              <1> ;       ecx = Number of chars in buffer.
